"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-15T15:46:20Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T15:46:20Z","body":"@reubenmanning @donn-xx Is this reproducible in any 4.5 version for either of you?\n\nI'm unable to reproduce this on Linux or Windows, but I also have an Nvidia card, and the freesync setting makes this seem like an AMD issue.\n\n> Godot v4.4.stable.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.3713) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3074213971/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3078690201","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104484#issuecomment-3078690201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104484","id":3078690201,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63gRWZ","user":{"login":"reubenmanning","id":50077706,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDc3NzA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50077706?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reubenmanning","html_url":"https://github.com/reubenmanning","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reubenmanning/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reubenmanning/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reubenmanning/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reubenmanning/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reubenmanning/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reubenmanning/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reubenmanning/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reubenmanning/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reubenmanning/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-16T13:41:30Z","updated_at":"2025-07-16T13:41:30Z","body":"@precup I haven't been able to replicate the issue on the latest 4.5 beta versions since the new AMD GPU drivers were released. Turning Freesync on and off doesn't make a difference anymore.\n\nIt's possible what I originally experienced was the result of a bad driver.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3078690201/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3571153451","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104484#issuecomment-3571153451","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104484","id":3571153451,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7U23or","user":{"login":"BuzzyBzzz","id":17770230,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzcwMjMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17770230?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz","html_url":"https://github.com/BuzzyBzzz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T14:46:16Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T14:46:16Z","body":"I can confirm that this issue is still present on all versions of Godot 4, and is probably tied to the GPU & GPU Driver. I'm able to fix it by using the 32bit version of the engine, but that did cause another strange issue that I'm going to report separately.\n\n**My Specs**\nGPU: Intel Arc 140V (Xe2 architecture, integrated, 128 MB dedicated + 8 GB shared)\nCPU: Intel Core Ultra 7 256V (Lunar Lake)\nRAM: 16 GB LPDDR5X-8533 (soldered)\n\nA few things that I tried to fix it:\nI've tried replicating what @reubenmanning did by turning off Intel's version of gsync/freesync, but I saw no improvement.\n<img width=\"637\" height=\"357\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd27c359-be80-4696-98bb-aa22b2817117\" />\n\nI also set windows to only use high-performance for Godot. Again; no improvement. I tried the inverse, and also no changes.\n<img width=\"1248\" height=\"585\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e1b1b65-16d0-4e9b-8b81-dc41de5c1984\" />\n\nI reverted to two older arc drivers to rule out a bad update, but the issue persisted in both.\n\nWhile it's probably not ideal I have found 2 working solutions for anyone else with the problem.\n1. Turn on single window mode.\n2. Use the 32-bit build of Godot (Single window can stay disabled.) Doing this prevents the 64-bit editor from opening unless the editor data is manually deleted.\n\nLet me know if I should make a new bug report for this instead of commenting since in my case it happens on both mono and non-mono.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3571153451/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3577503958","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104484#issuecomment-3577503958","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104484","id":3577503958,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VPGDW","user":{"login":"BuzzyBzzz","id":17770230,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzcwMjMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17770230?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz","html_url":"https://github.com/BuzzyBzzz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzyBzzz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-25T20:41:59Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T20:41:59Z","body":"I've managed to solve this on my Intel PC (without using 32-bit or single-window mode) by manually locating & installing the generic drivers for my graphics card instead of the OEM-approved ones that Intel distributes through their update tools.\nThe latest driver provided through their updater was around 4 months older than the generic version so I'm guessing this was an issue that got fixed in a more recent update.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3577503958/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confuse